# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and in checkouts, on every platform.
# Checksummed and byte-compared files (project/library files, test fixtures) must never be
# converted to CRLF by Git on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.foslib -text
*.fosp -text
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
